# Docker build context. Same allowlist as .gcloudignore: only build inputs
# and runtime files. Everything else (worktrees in .claude/, docs, tests,
# test output, local data, secrets) never reaches the image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!Dockerfile
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.server.json
!vite.views.config.ts
!src
!public

**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
**/secrets
**/credentials
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/service-account*.json
**/service_account*.json
**/*-credentials.json
